  "identifier": "pydicom",
  "name": "pydicom",
  "description": "The standard Python library for reading, modifying, and writing DICOM files. Used in virtually every Python-based medical imaging pipeline — from research scripts to production clinical AI. Handles the full DICOM data model including pixel data, metadata, and transfer syntaxes.",
