  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The de-facto standard for DICOM file handling in Python. 2,200+ GitHub stars, pip-installable, actively maintained with a March 2026 release. Used as a foundational dependency by nnU-Net, MONAI, TotalSegmentator, SimpleITK, and most clinical AI pipelines. No credible alternative exists in the Python ecosystem for direct DICOM file I/O. MIT license, community-governed.",
